# Publish-ready mp4s land here

Output files (`*.mp4`, `*-thumb.jpg`) in this directory are gitignored
per the repo-wide patterns in `/.gitignore`.  This `.gitkeep` exists so
the directory itself is committed and survives a clean clone.

Workflow:
1. `agents/missions/music-video/run.sh <id> <music> [keywords]`
   produces `records/missions/<date>/<id>/outputs/short.mp4`.
2. Operator-approved candidates get copied here as
   `<NN>-<music-slug>-<keyword-tag>.mp4` for the upload step.
3. The companion `*-thumb.jpg` is the mid-frame preview from the
   same mission.

License + provenance for any track used in a published mp4 should
already be in [`assets/music/SOURCES.md`](../../assets/music/SOURCES.md).
